# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Two directories below are ignored here and tracked anyway, on purpose.
#
# `out/` and `pdk/` are derived: the first by running the pipeline, the second
# by tools/fetch_pdk.py and tools/fetch_open_pdks.py. They were committed in
# bee6d70 because the machine that produced them was being sold, and a pinned
# snapshot of the evidence is worth more than a promise that it can be
# regenerated. What is committed stays committed; these rules stop a later run
# from sweeping in every new artifact it happens to write.
out/
pdk/
